BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: TorontoBabel Language Exchange
UID:event_314641332@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260531T043449Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260603T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260603T230000
SUMMARY:4th Year Anniversary Event & Language Exchange Social @ Rivoli by 
 Toronto Babel
DESCRIPTION:TorontoBabel: Toronto's International Language Exchange\n🎉 
 TORONTO BABEL — OFFICIAL 4 YEAR ANNIVERSARY 🎉\n\n📍 The Rivoli — 
 332 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M5V 2A2 — ONE NIGHT ONLY REUNION\n\n🗓
 ️ Wednesday\, June 3\n🕖 7:00 PM – 11:00 PM\n\nJoin us as we celebra
 te our 4th Year Anniversary of Toronto Babel with Terry as our Head Organi
 zer! Did you know that we are one of the longest running language exchange
 s in the city since 2010\, now with over 18\,000 members on Meetup.com! 
 🌍💬 We’ll also be paying tribute to some of the past hosts who help
 ed shape the Toronto Babel community over the years\, including Eduardo\, 
 Beth\, and Valentina. 🙌\n\nToronto Babel restarted 4 years ago just as 
 the city began lifting pandemic restrictions\, creating a space for people
  to reconnect through language\, culture\, and community. Since then\, we
 ’ve welcomed attendees from all over the world and helped spark new frie
 ndships\, conversations\, and unforgettable memories along the way.\n\nFor
  this special anniversary event\, we’re excited to announce the return t
 o Rivoli — the ORIGINAL home of Toronto Babel — for ONE NIGHT ONLY! 
 ❤️\n\nWe’re also offering FREE Anniversary Cake — first come\, fir
 st serve! 🎂✨\n\n✨ What to expect:\n✅ Language Exchange & Social M
 ixer\n✅ Billiard Tables 🎱\n✅ Arcade Games 🕹️\n✅ Table Soccer
  ⚽\n✅ Raffle and Prizes 🎁\n✅ Free Cake 🎂\n\n💵 $5 Entry Dona
 tion\nYour contribution helps cover meetup costs\, name tags\, games\, and
  all the little extras that make the night special ✨\n\n📲 E-transfer 
 also available:\n[tmg8@wealthsimple.me](mailto:tmg8@wealthsimple.me)\n\n
 🔗 Meetup:\n[http://www.meetup.com/TorontoBabel](http://www.meetup.com/T
 orontoBabel)\n\n📘 Facebook:\n[https://www.facebook.com/groups/torontoba
 bel](https://www.facebook.com/groups/torontobabel)\n\n💬 WhatsApp:\n[htt
 ps://chat.whatsapp.com/EYMdUw8XaxE5irFSNg5bt7](https://chat.whatsapp.com/E
 YMdUw8XaxE5irFSNg5bt7)\n\n👉 Check out the calendar & RSVP:\n[http://www
 .meetup.com/TorontoBabel/#calendar](http://www.meetup.com/TorontoBabel/#ca
 lendar)\n\n📝 Note: Toronto Babel is a welcoming and safe space for all 
 attendees. Any form of harassment or inappropriate behavior will not be to
 lerated. If you experience or witness any issues\, please inform one of th
 e organizers immediately so we can address it appropriately.\n\n#TorontoBa
 bel #LanguageExchange #TorontoEvents #TorontoLife #PracticeLanguages
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontobabel/events/314641332/
